# {{ plugin_name }} is ready

1. Read CONTRIBUTING.md, install mise, then run `mise trust` and `mise install`.
2. Install the hooks with `mise exec -- prek install`, then run `mise run test` and `mise run lint`.
3. Replace the example action and update README.md; run `mise run docs` afterwards.
4. Configure the GitHub `release` environment and App credentials described in CONTRIBUTING.md.

No setup call is required to try `:{{ command_name }}`.
